(loading_container_leg_linked ?loading_container ?transport_leg)
(origin_leg_loaded ?transport_leg)
(not (destination_leg_loaded ?transport_leg))
(not (candidate_clearance_established ?candidate))

Effect: candidate_clearance_established ?candidate and route_sequence_context_set ?candidate

Establish_clearance_destination_loaded: similar but with destination_leg_loaded and not origin_leg_loaded.

Establish_clearance_full_load: both origin_leg_loaded and destination_leg_loaded.

